resources.string:
1. Save the nucleic acid code as a screenshot locally;
2. Open Wearfit Pro and enter Device-Nucleic Acid Code;
3. Click the QR code area above to add or replace the nucleic acid QR code;
4, Click the binding button below to bind the nucleic acid code to the bracelet;

· The other party does not authorize you to view location sharing permissions;
· The device is not connected to the network or the network is relatively poor;
· Do not use or close the APP for a long time;
· Wearfit Pro is not always allowed to use your location when you are not using the app; (please go to the mobile app market to open the Wearfit Pro APP "Always Allow" permission)

1. During the installation of the application, please do not leave this page, do not operate mobile phones and watches, to ensure that the installation is complete;
2. If you do not see the he/she's health status and location data on the watch, please check whether the watch and the mobile phone are always connected and the network is unblocked, and check whether the other party authorizes you to view the he/she's data;
3. In order to provide you and the he/she with more accurate data, please follow the "device-background protection" operation path in the APP to set the APP as a background protection program to ensure that the APP is not closed by the mobile phone, and is not closed artificially APP program;
4. To obtain location information, it is necessary to ensure that APP is always allowed to obtain mobile phone location permissions;
5. The health data results are for reference only, not as a basis for medical diagnosis;

1. During the installation of the application, please do not leave this page, do not operate mobile phones and watches, to ensure that the installation is complete;
2. If you do not see the blood glucose data on the watch, please check whether the watch and the mobile phone are always connected and the network is unblocked;
3. In order to provide you with more accurate data, please set the APP as a background protection program according to the "device-background protection" path to ensure that the APP is not closed by the mobile phone;
4. The blood glucose result is for reference only, not as a basis for medical diagnosis;

1. During the installation of the application, please do not leave this page, do not operate mobile phones and watches, to ensure that the installation is complete;
2. If you do not see the respiratory rate data on the watch, please check whether the watch and the mobile phone are always connected and the network is unblocked;
3. In order to provide you with more accurate data, please set the APP as a background protection program according to the "device-background protection" path to ensure that the APP is not closed by the mobile phone;
4. The results of respiratory rate are for reference only, not as a basis for medical diagnosis;

1. Turn on location sharing permission, which means you agree to authorize sharing your location with he/she;
2. Please set Wearfit Pro to "Always allow access to location" permission in the phone system settings;
3. Please press "Device"-"Background Protection" in the APP to set the APP as a background protection program;
4. During use, please do not manually close the APP running process;
5. If the location of the other party is not updated for more than 10 minutes after refreshing, it may be that the other party has closed the APP process;
